    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Forbes Property is delighted to present Apartment 26 St. Patrick's Court to the market—a bright, light-filled one-bedroom apartment situated in the heart of historic Dublin 8.\n\nPositioned in an enviable Dublin City Southside location, this charming home offers the ultimate urban lifestyle. Tucked quietly on Clanbrassil Street, residents are spoiled for choice with Portobello's scenic canal walks, Camden Street's vibrant dining scene, and the tranquil grounds of St. Patrick's Cathedral Park all just moments from the front door.\n\nSituated on the second floor, Apartment 26 enjoys a bright, elevated outlook over the surrounding streetscape towards Dublin City Centre. Set well above street level, the property offers enhanced privacy, excellent natural light, and serene city living just a short stroll from St. Stephen's Green and Grafton Street.\n\nIdeal for first-time buyers seeking a turn-key, walk-to-work city base or investors looking for a prime D8 asset. Step outside and enjoy effortless living with immediate access to the LUAS Green Line, Dublinbike stations, and top universities and tech hubs all within a short stroll."
